        <mxCell id="r9ALvnWOJIYnFNB3vxs8-1" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;Формула для расчета 61.WithdrawalFeeCurrencyAmount взята с л. &quot;OperationData_Fixed2&quot;. Над листе &quot;ForwardUserAmountCalc3&quot; в случае если &lt;span style=&quot;text-align: left; text-wrap: nowrap;&quot;&gt;WithdrawalFeeType=&quot;Coefficient&quot;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;WithdrawalFee&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: left; text-wrap: nowrap;&quot;&gt;расчитывается по другому:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: left; text-wrap: nowrap;&quot;&gt;(WithdrawalFee*UserExchangeCurrencyAmount)*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: left; text-wrap: nowrap;&quot;&gt;(1-ServiceFeeCoefficient)/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-wrap: nowrap; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;ExchangeToWithdrawalFeeCurrencyRate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-wrap: nowrap; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;darkOpacity=0.05;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-750" y="209" width="324" height="114" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
